# HSBlackJack

Automates blackjacking Menaphite Thugs in Pollnivneach: finds and lures a thug into a private tent,
manages the curtain, knocks them out, and pickpockets twice before repeating.

## Features

- Full lure → tent → knock-out → pickpocket cycle, using the NPC's own animation IDs to confirm a
  successful knock-out as fast as possible instead of guessing timing.
- Detects a rejected lure ("Go away! I'm busy") over several ticks rather than a single flag check,
  to avoid false positives.
- Automatically hops worlds if the tent is already occupied by another NPC (or player), or if a lured
  NPC never makes it inside in time.
- Recovers from real combat (the "You can't do this during combat." block) by unequipping the
  blackjack, breaking the NPC out of combat, then re-equipping and resuming.
- Automatic food (Jug of wine) restocking from Faisal the Barman, including a minimum-stock check that
  hops worlds if the shop itself is low on stock.
- Opens coin pouches automatically once you're carrying 27+.
- Smart, transport-aware travel to the starting position from anywhere in Gielinor (fairy rings,
  Shantay Pass, etc.) at plugin start.
- Overlay panel with live status, a short action history, knock-out/pickpocket counts, and XP/hr.